## Data Flow

### Online inference read path
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Inference Client
  participant FS as Feature Store API
  participant PG as Postgres
  participant R as Redis

  C->>FS: GetFeatures(keys, feature_refs, model)
  FS->>PG: Resolve refs + policies (cached)
  PG-->>FS: Versions + TTL + rules
  FS->>R: MGET entity keys
  R-->>FS: Values + event_time
  FS-->>C: Values + per-feature status + request_id
```

### Streaming materialization
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as Event Log
  participant SJ as Spark Streaming
  participant R as Redis
  participant L as Lakehouse

  E->>SJ: Events (entity_key, event_time, payload)
  SJ->>SJ: Transform + dedup + windows
  SJ->>R: Upsert latest-by-entity
  SJ->>L: Append offline feature facts
```

